     }
-    // jit.irqchain=on|off: off sets MELONDS_JIT_NOIRQCHAIN=1, on unsets it (melonDS patch 0022: a block chain goes
+    // jit.irqchain=on|off: off sets MELONDS_JIT_NOIRQCHAIN=1, on unsets it (melonDS patch 0023: a block chain goes
